            "title": "居屋王富榮花園2房575萬沽 長情業主20年勁賺3.3倍",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"562\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3abee7b105f06617ba9f011f6ec62d5c8f28cf09e839f73ac596deb93ea7e4cd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2F28hse_com_210%2F834ec0d96544ba8e0ab73e267191c97a.jpg_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></div></figure></div>",
